


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_5896bb15:


    "『洛·巧克·巧克』的介绍视频以让文对着镜头吃巧克力这种老套的剪接来结束。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_7d44da0b:


    "伦因为太吵被阳菜赏了一通揍。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_f31f41cc:



    voice "2FU_0917"
    fumi "「完全不知道伦竟然过来了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_69d491be:


    "文看完了那个环节后一脸松了一口气的样子。画面上也开始播放着在其他店拍的帅哥综艺节目。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_d49b85da:



    voice "2HI_1162"
    hina "「喂。这不是没对上眼神吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_7285b0f3:



    voice "2RI_1204"
    rin "「啊咧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_ba7f3760:


    "似乎这旁述有点掺假。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_3ef81551:



    voice "2FU_0918"
    fumi "「伦竟然在三个小时前就待在那了。应该会很冷吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_f6546c09:



    voice "2RI_1205"
    rin "「这可是文的出道节目哦？我不在一旁守望怎么行！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_21000c6c:



    voice "2FU_0919"
    fumi "「说是出道就太夸张了。只是个店铺的介绍而已呀」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_8b39e98c:



    voice "2RI_1206"
    rin "「那是因为文还不知道传说已经迎来了开端——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_50ab2a86:


    "伦正说着，文的手机响了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_8ef59450:



    voice "2SA_0773"
    sachiko "「家里打来的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_9eec8141:



    voice "2FU_0920"
    fumi "「不，是个陌生号码呢……也不是通知电话，总之我接一下看看吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_51d4e252:



    voice "2FU_0921"
    fumi "「喂您好，我是浅生……桂木Production？啊！今天承蒙您关照了——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_ab171100:



    voice "2HI_1163"
    hina "「桂木Production是什么来着？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_2700d89c:



    voice "2SA_0774"
    sachiko "「应该是艺能事务所吧？我记得刚才的ParReg就是那事务所的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_9cc3e206:



    voice "2MI_0939"
    miyako "「你知道的真详细呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_2c922dcf:



    voice "2SA_0775"
    sachiko "「你们在学校上课的时候我还是经常看电视的嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_eb951767:



    voice "2RI_1207"
    rin "「ParReg所属的事务所？我倒还挺想去投诉一下她们对文性骚扰的说」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_f3c2a644:



    voice "2FU_0922"
    fumi "「诶诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_0c73c90d:


    "一边不断点着头一边惶恐地通话着的文突然拉高了音量。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_5f48cc94:



    voice "2RI_1208"
    rin "「什么？怎么了——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_b65b4e89:



    voice "2FU_0923"
    fumi "「试镜？让我去当偶像？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_db55c1a0:



    voice "2RI_1209"
    rin "「哈啊！？」"



translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_cc0630a2:


    voice "2SA_0775"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_08_1ace0da0:


    sachiko "「你们在学校上课的时候我还是经常看电视的嘛」"
